# Memory & Checkpoints

## Single-owner rule

Each fact lives in **exactly one** canonical file. Others link — never copy.

| Content | Owner |
|---------|-------|
| Phase, metrics, active work | `memories/repo/project_structure.md` |
| Session handoff | `docs/memory/checkpoint_YYYY-MM-DD.md` |
| ADRs | `docs/adr/` |
| Activity log | `wiki/log.md` (append-only) |

## Checkpoints

- Write at every natural session end — user should not have to ask
- Include: command run + 2–5 lines observed output for live proofs
- Immutable after session — don't edit past checkpoints; add new one

## Generator

```bash
python scripts/session_checkpoint.py -m "brief summary"
```

## Lint

```bash
python scripts/fact_lint.py      # duplicate facts
python scripts/obsidian_lint.py  # broken wiki links
```
